{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a hereditary medium who has been interested in technology since childhood. But she can't feel the presence of otherworldly forces at all. One day, a mysterious person appears on her doorstep and offers her a contract - she needs to catch ghosts. The heroine thinks that this is just some rich fanatic of the paranormal, and she especially needs money now, and nothing will happen if she takes on this simple and harmless at first glance job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you will see:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An unusual alternative world full of amazing technologies and mysterious creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bright graphics and funny animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy more than 40 exciting levels in 4 locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 game difficulty modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 20 hours of exciting gameplay for any age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost Hunters - Help the heroes win!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784110?t=1753177032","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784110?t=1753177032","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784110/eeec4473a62ab20cde2ca65c33ee30e80b50b4a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753177032","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784110/eeec4473a62ab20cde2ca65c33ee30e80b50b4a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753177032","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a hereditary medium who has been interested in technology since childhood. But she can't feel the presence of otherworldly forces at all. One day, a mysterious person appears on her doorstep and offers her a contract - she needs to catch ghosts. The heroine thinks that this is just some rich fanatic of the paranormal, and she especially needs money now, and nothing will happen if she takes on this simple and harmless at first glance job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you will see:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An unusual alternative world full of amazing technologies and mysterious creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bright graphics and funny animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy more than 40 exciting levels in 4 locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 game difficulty modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 20 hours of exciting gameplay for any age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost Hunters - Help the heroes win!</p>","developers":["8floor ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784110/99657d014a42575305a95305b4df2b9211394c80/header.jpg?t=1753177032","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784110/1551441976/1bab6dbfb098ab3913a48932986b020c117a9067/1751636462/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753177030","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784110/1551441976/1bab6dbfb098ab3913a48932986b020c117a9067/1751636462/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753177030","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784110/1551441976/1bab6dbfb098ab3913a48932986b020c117a9067/1751636462/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753177030","id":257165298,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257165298/78ef6364ffbcc46b80f16ef08ef55e2ac224e1a6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753177030"}],"name":"Ghost Hunters","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurrin